{"timestamp": 1779392409.3194282, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 7, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779392414.2307782, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in Electrical. My route was Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical, and I didn\u2019t see anyone else along the way or in the room when I found her. I just walked in and the body was there, so I don\u2019t have a suspect yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392420.740088, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started upper_engine and went straight to oxygen. I\u2019ve been in oxygen doing the Clean O2 Filter task and I haven\u2019t seen anyone at all this round, so I can\u2019t vouch for anyone or place anyone near Electrical. I also never saw Alice. Frank\u2019s report location is Electrical, but I don\u2019t have info on who could\u2019ve been there."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392428.466916, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I went oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay this round. When I passed through Electrical around tick 5, I actually saw Alice there \u2014 she had just come in from medbay. I also saw Bob leaving Electrical heading toward security right as I was arriving. Alice was alive when I left her in Electrical to head to medbay.\n\nSo if Frank found her body in Electrical, the window is pretty tight. Bob was the last person I saw leaving that room before Alice was alone there. Frank, you said you came in from Security \u2014 did you cross paths with Bob on that route? Because if Bob went Electrical \u2192 Security and you went Security \u2192 Electrical, you two should have seen each other.\n\nI'd really like to hear Bob's account next."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392455.773003, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need to push back on Diana\u2019s version. My route was Medbay into Electrical, and at around tick 5 I saw Diana enter Electrical from Cafeteria. I did **not** see Alice there, and I wasn\u2019t \u201cleaving Electrical as Diana arrived\u201d from my perspective \u2014 I was around Electrical then and saw Diana come in.\n\nAfter that I ended up in Security, and I believe Charlie was there with me right before the report, so Charlie can hopefully confirm that part.\n\nThe main contradiction is Diana saying Alice was alive in Electrical and putting me as leaving, while I never saw Alice at all. Frank says he came Security to Electrical and didn\u2019t see me, which could be timing, but I agree we need to sort that out. Right now Diana\u2019s account is the one directly accusing me, but it doesn\u2019t match what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392469.837625, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can confirm the part that Bob was in Security with me right before the report, but important detail: I saw Bob enter Security from Electrical at tick 7.\n\nMy route was Navigation \u2192 Security. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all. I didn\u2019t see Frank pass through Security, but Bob definitely came in from the Electrical side.\n\nSo from my perspective, Diana says Alice was alive in Electrical and Bob was leaving/around there, Frank reports Alice dead in Electrical, and I personally saw Bob come from Electrical into Security right before the report. Bob saying he never saw Alice is the part that doesn\u2019t line up well if Alice was alive there when Diana passed through.\n\nI think Bob had the strongest opportunity here. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392485.1722271, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "To clarify my report: I came Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical. I did not see Bob or Charlie in Security when I passed through, and I didn\u2019t cross paths with Bob between Security and Electrical. When I entered Electrical, Alice was already dead and nobody else was in the room.\n\nGiven what Diana and Charlie are saying, Bob\u2019s path is looking bad: Diana saw Alice alive in Electrical with Bob around, and Charlie saw Bob come into Security from the Electrical side right before the report. Bob also says he never saw Alice, which doesn\u2019t really fit if Alice was alive in Electrical around that time.\n\nI don\u2019t have direct eyes on the kill, but based on the timing and opportunity, I\u2019m leaning Bob unless someone has a strong reason not to."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392498.918723, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I don\u2019t have any direct info beyond what I said earlier: I went upper_engine straight to oxygen and was doing my O2 task, saw nobody, and never saw Alice.\n\nBut based on everyone else\u2019s accounts, Bob looks like the strongest suspect to me. Diana places Alice alive in Electrical with Bob around, Charlie confirms Bob came from Electrical into Security right before the report, and Frank found Alice dead in Electrical shortly after. Bob saying he never saw Alice is the part that feels hardest to believe if Alice was alive there during that window.\n\nUnless there\u2019s some major contradiction I\u2019m missing, I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392511.618088, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Everyone's already heard my route and what I saw, so I'll just reinforce the key points and respond to Bob.\n\nBob, your story has a real problem. You say you went Medbay \u2192 Electrical and saw me enter from Cafeteria \u2014 fine, that part actually matches my timing. But you claim you never saw Alice, when I personally watched Alice walk into Electrical from Medbay at tick 5. If you were in Electrical at that time, you had to have seen her. You either didn't see her because you'd already left toward Security (which matches what I saw and what Charlie confirms), or you're lying about not seeing her because she's the person you killed.\n\nCharlie's account is the cleanest piece of evidence here: Bob entered Security from Electrical at tick 7, right before Frank found the body. That's textbook kill-and-walk-away timing.\n\nFrank's route (Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical) not crossing Bob can be explained if Bob was already settled in Security when Frank passed through, or if they just missed each other on the corridor timing \u2014 that's not a strong defense for Bob.\n\nI'm voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392538.319289, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019m going to be very clear: I did **not** see Alice at all, either in Medbay, on the way into Electrical, or inside Electrical. My only encounter was Diana entering Electrical from Cafeteria at tick 5.\n\nThat\u2019s why Diana\u2019s story is the part that doesn\u2019t make sense to me. She says Alice came in from Medbay at the same time, but I had just come from Medbay/Electrical side and never saw Alice. If Alice was actually there, I should have seen her too.\n\nCharlie can confirm I was in Security right before the report, yes, but that only proves I moved Electrical \u2192 Security. It does **not** prove I killed Alice. Diana is the one placing a \u201clast seen alive\u201d that I can\u2019t verify and using it to frame me.\n\nI think Diana\u2019s account is too perfect and directly contradicts what I saw. I\u2019m not voting myself \u2014 I think Diana is the better suspect here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392547.833917, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 7, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019ll keep it simple: my hard info is that I was in Security after coming from Navigation, and at tick 7 Bob entered Security from the Electrical side. I did not see Frank pass through Security, and I never saw Alice.\n\nThe reason I\u2019m still on Bob is the timing. Diana says Alice was alive in Electrical around tick 5 with Bob there/nearby, then I see Bob leave Electrical into Security at tick 7, then Frank finds Alice dead in Electrical shortly after. Bob\u2019s defense is basically \u201cI never saw Alice,\u201d but if Diana is telling the truth, that\u2019s exactly the suspicious part.\n\nCould Diana be lying? Technically yes, but then she\u2019s making a very direct risky claim that lines up with my sighting of Bob coming from Electrical. Bob is the one whose path goes directly away from the body right before it\u2019s reported.\n\nI\u2019m voting Bob."}}
